center;\"><div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">做伙來唸詩</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃芳儀<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">櫻花</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">姚雅芳<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/blog-post_2.html\" target=\"_blank\">稻仔</a><br />2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳昭蓉<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/blog-post_75.html\" target=\"_blank\">囡仔歌</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">3</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Jī Hiann<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/iahe.html\" target=\"_blank\">是雨iah是歷史ê目屎</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>4</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">A-Koan<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/jin-kan-thian-tong.html\" target=\"_blank\">Jîn-kan Thian-tông</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/jin-kan-thian-tong.html\" target=\"_blank\">人間天堂</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>44</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">佈稻仔</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>7</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">文學káng「台」</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">石牧民<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/etsangthang.html\" target=\"_blank\">台灣文學、台語文學ê「現代」tsáng頭（五）：有thang用</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>8</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳育萱<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/ekape.html\" target=\"_blank\">現代女性ê母親身份kap對婚姻ê期待</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者／陳信從</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台譯／陳理揚<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/e_2.html\" target=\"_blank\">家庭對母語ê重要</a><br />34</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sio招來看戲</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林榮淑<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/blog-post_48.html\" target=\"_blank\">戲搬《那就唱歌吧！》</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">郭文玄<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/blog-post_7.html\" target=\"_blank\">金仔海岸</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">棲地復育台語講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／駱明永</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／田永承<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/e_7.html\" target=\"_blank\">土地頂頭白色ê星——台灣百合</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>19</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／林祥註</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／顏郁珊<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/tui.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tuì「紙便當盒仔發電」到「環保衛生紙」——造紙業簡介</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">21</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張偉萍<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/blog-post_85.html\" target=\"_blank\">鬧熱（二）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳掄瑜<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/e_8.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿媽是我ê靠山</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>27</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">景景<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/siau.html\" target=\"_blank\">Siàu念阮阿公，有孝阮阿媽</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>29</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳慕真<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/blog-post_18.html\" target=\"_blank\">故人略歷</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>33</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蕭聿萱<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/e.html\" target=\"_blank\">寂寞ê白賊話</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2021阿却賞tio̍h獎作品——短篇小說</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khó͘ Pōe-bín<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/blog-post_9.html\" target=\"_blank\">溝（二）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>38</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/e_9.html\" target=\"_blank\">物理ê世界</a></span></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/06/e_9.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bu̍t-lí ê Sè-kài</span></a></div><div><